From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] winedmo: Complete audio MFT drain with NEED_MORE_INPUT

Once a drained transform has delivered all of its output, ProcessOutput is
expected to return MF_E_TRANSFORM_NEED_MORE_INPUT. The winedmo AAC and WMA
decoders instead translated the Unix decoder's terminal STATUS_END_OF_FILE
into MF_E_END_OF_STREAM.

Warrior Cats: Clans of the Forest plays its intro videos through Unreal's
ElectraPlayer. The video-only clips finish, but playback stops on the first
clip with an AAC track after both decoders reach end of stream, and the game
never reaches the main menu.

Apply the fix made to the video decoder in 0023 to the audio decoders too,
matching the MFT contract and the previous WineGStreamer decoder behavior.

Fixes: https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom/issues/882
Rebased 2026-10-30: drop audio_decoder hunk (file removed in 0001 rebase,
upstream moved to aac_decoder); keep wma_decoder fix.
---
 dlls/winedmo/wma_decoder.c   | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/wma_decoder.c b/dlls/winedmo/wma_decoder.c
index 368e7c6..6c75133 100644
--- a/dlls/winedmo/wma_decoder.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/wma_decoder.c
@@ -743,7 +743,7 @@ retry:
     else if (ntstatus == STATUS_END_OF_FILE)
     {
         samples->dwStatus = MFT_OUTPUT_DATA_BUFFER_NO_SAMPLE;
-        hr = MF_E_END_OF_STREAM;
+        hr = MF_E_TRANSFORM_NEED_MORE_INPUT;
     }
     else
     {
